        "The following cycle is a good moment to test When should a BDR team use a round-robin sender model in the next review cycle against one real case before changing the template. New team members should be able to understand the rotation in a few minutes. If the rules require a long explanation, simplify them. The purpose is a predictable system that protects both the buyer and the team. Separate what the team observed from what it assumed before publishing the result."
